# Pavel's Research (Q120), cond 19 to the end: the stones send the character to the west weather
# master, whose riddles end at cond 22 (his cast at the character is
# q120_pavels_research_west_cast); the stones give the heart of Atlanta, Wendy takes it and gives
# her necklace, and Yumi takes the necklace for the earring of binding; then relog. Q114 is
# completed, so the stones, Wendy and Yumi go through the quest chooser. Expectations replay
# the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q120_pavels_research_finish.golden
character Researcher 50
quest Q114_ResurrectionOfAnOldManager <state>=COMPLETED
quest Q120_PavelsResearch <cond>=19 <state>=STARTED talk=0 talk1=0
